					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-405333#post-1293050</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-405333/getting-under-his-skin#post-1293050</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 28 Oct 2011 21:14:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ChazzK</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1203158</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>We shot it. It became bullet proof.<br /> We burned it. It became fireproof.<br /> We dunked it in acid. It learned how to drink it.<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">We shot it into space. It came back with wings and on fire.</span><br /> We locked it into a room. It ate something else and figured out how to get into the wires.<br /> We isolated the wires. It figured out how to break them through walls.<br /> We made the walls thicker. It figured out how to break them through <em>us</em>.<br /> &#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;..<br /> We shot each other. It watched and laughed.<br /> We burned ourselves. It was in the next room.<br /> We sealed the doors. It wanted to be inside with us.<br /> We told the world to stay out. It invited the world back in.<br /> We made sure nothing could live inside any more. Its flesh died.<br /> &#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;&#8230;..<br /> The world finally felt ready to open the door again.<br /> It was waiting.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
